   "id": "5260ed98-0e06-1236-54f0-5afbd449514e",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"sub-heading-text\">Our mission is to scale matcha across all industries.<br data-w-id=\"3b26a47b-1e52-03f7-b461-ed0056ebe291\"><br data-w-id=\"9649f713-8be1-c49d-bf5d-052671bb8875\">Transforming it from a specialty product into a daily essential in people’s lives. Through strategic partnerships, innovation and education we are shaping the futureof matcha on a global scale.<br data-w-id=\"5260ed98-0e06-1236-54f0-5afbd4495151\"></p>",
    "text": "Our mission is to scale matcha across all industries.\n\nTransforming it from a specialty product into a daily essential in people’s lives. Through strategic partnerships, innovation and education we are shaping the futureof matcha on a global scale.\n"
