  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "e71bfbab-98e0-eafa-f48d-1d0aa19ae99a",
   "text": {
    "html": "<h1 class=\"heading-5-2\"><span class=\"text-span-6\" data-w-id=\"e71bfbab-98e0-eafa-f48d-1d0aa19ae99b\">Our trusted <br data-w-id=\"d59b8323-6b17-90ce-41f2-4ff1154e52dc\"></span>sourcing<span class=\"text-span-6\" data-w-id=\"4b8ba7f3-3a12-31b1-fcdf-c8c77e4131e4\"> process</span></h1>",
    "text": "Our trusted \nsourcing process"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "e71bfbab-98e0-eafa-f48d-1d0aa19ae9a1",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"text-block-75-2\"><strong data-w-id=\"a2b2b2e3-6933-0061-4c14-298f1a132062\">Farm selection</strong><br data-w-id=\"8294e211-3e3e-8a33-82bc-9bc01c02879d\">We partner with family-run farms in Japan’s top matcha-growing regions, focusing on continiusly and sustainable cultivation.<br data-w-id=\"d2e8e379-2c7e-12f3-cd82-e409aeb3b209\"><br data-w-id=\"7b42a6a1-26cc-3668-eda8-9eafc8d8c2ac\"><strong data-w-id=\"dac129f0-f5d4-4dbe-bef9-bf024853f5a1\">Streamline the supply chain<br data-w-id=\"1a85b473-6da6-8a6e-30b4-8db8fc26ff07\"></strong>From harvest to packaging, we work closely with our partners to optimize every step — ensuring consistent quality, traceability, and efficiency.<br data-w-id=\"34b79a30-c8ec-3468-c0e2-f3a3722457d3\"><br data-w-id=\"fefef6c9-dde9-4a3f-6e17-00e92b818dfc\"><strong data-w-id=\"1ca7d895-c34a-8373-26b9-3688f56d0aa3\">Strong partnerships<br data-w-id=\"74d11580-619b-7474-6edd-eca83302e57d\"></strong>We maintain close, direct relationships with our suppliers — building trust, ensuring transparency, and growing together for the long term.<br data-w-id=\"7f11513c-30f0-4154-3a01-8748e8057148\">‍<br data-w-id=\"61d221df-d6ae-9c79-9bb2-6fe7d85af146\">‍</div>",
    "text": "Farm selection\nWe partner with family-run farms in Japan’s top matcha-growing regions, focusing on continiusly and sustainable cultivation.\n\nStreamline the supply chain\nFrom harvest to packaging, we work closely with our partners to optimize every step — ensuring consistent quality, traceability, and efficiency.\n\nStrong partnerships\nWe maintain close, direct relationships with our suppliers — building trust, ensuring transparency, and growing together for the long term.\n‍\n‍"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "83aa51b7-217a-8af2-ae05-6b683c8a5c52",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"text-block-75-2\">Beyond Japan, our group sources specialty crops and consolidates supply through our Hong Kong–based sourcing partner:</p>",
    "text": "Beyond Japan, our group sources specialty crops and consolidates supply through our Hong Kong–based sourcing partner:"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "0aaee4e4-b680-9164-ee9f-b26336aed911",
   "text": {
    "html": "<a class=\"text-block-75-2\" href=\"https://www.superfoodspartners.com/\">Superfoods Partners — bulk matcha, tea &amp; superfoods, documented via Hong Kong →</a>",
    "text": "Superfoods Partners — bulk matcha, tea & superfoods, documented via Hong Kong →"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "cb51b63c-b7ce-7804-0e12-258f0a319690",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"text-size-large-4 text-weight-semibold\">Ready to get started?</div>",
    "text": "Ready to get started?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "cb51b63c-b7ce-7804-0e12-258f0a319693",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"text-size-regular\">We are available to give you the best advise on the best matcha for your company's industry</p>",
